  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a June 2023 statement, Dominique Duval-Diop said that getting data AI-ready poses some of the same challenges that are being confronted. In a July 18, 2023 statement, she said that with data science and artificial intelligence developments happening daily, it is crucial to have a wide array of technical perspectives at policy tables to ensure these developments benefit all Americans and protect against potential harms. An undated supplied excerpt contains similar language about the importance of a wide array of technical perspectives amid daily developments in data science and artificial intelligence.",
